        "reviews": "“To me, it works perfectly as that game you open to relax and, ironically, end up leaving more nervous than when you started, but with the smile of someone who won by mastering the details.”<br>80/100 – Patobah<br><br>“Arrow Survival: 15 Seconds is an indie game that doesn't say &quot;I'm going to change your life,&quot; but promises to get your heart racing, test your reflexes, and make you laugh nervously all at the same time.”<br>GameHall<br><br>“Arrow Survival: 15 Seconds is a game that knows exactly what it wants to be and delivers that experience in a direct and challenging way. It doesn't waste time with plots, cinematics, or elaborate explanations. It features simple yet deep mechanics, short but intense levels, and a difficulty curve that will test the patience and skill of any player.”<br>ComboCaster<br>",
